<%%#
  The icons every tool's call and return use, then one pair of lines per
  tool. Add a pair for each tool the agent has:

    <span slot="tool.NAME.call">Doing the thing&hellip;</span>
    <span slot="tool.NAME.return">Did the thing</span>
%>
<img slot="tool.*.call-icon" src="/images/rubydev.svg" alt="">
<img slot="tool.*.return-icon" src="/images/rubydev.svg" alt="">
